==Battleground==
*5 [[Mr. Angel]]s (150%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s (150%) spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mr. Angel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns.
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns.
**5 [[Mr. Angel]]s (150%) spawn, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns.
**1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], especially with Research [[Cat Combo|combo]]s, is very necessary here because all the enemies are [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel enemies]]. If you have [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Miasma Cat]], it will also work well even without its [[True Form]]. It is also [[Immune to Weaken]] as a bonus. For Winged Pigge and Boraphim, use long-range units, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] (who is also immune to weaken). You can also use Talented [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] or [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] to slow the enemies' pushing. Once the main pushers are down, you win the battle.

